+------------------ COLD‑START DELAY ------------------+

  [BAT+]------------------------+------------------+
                                |                  |
                               [RCH] 100kΩ        [SW_MAIN]
                                |                  |
                               [CDELAY] 10µF       |
                                |                  |
                               NODE_DELAY          +----> DRIVER_ENABLE
                                |
  [BAT-]------------------------+------------------+

  NODE_DELAY --> [Q1] NPN (inverter)
                  |
                  +--> ENABLE_LINE (HIGH only after CDELAY charged)

  BEHAVIOR:
  - On power‑up, CDELAY is empty → NODE_DELAY low → ENABLE_LINE low.
  - After ~RCH·CDELAY, NODE_DELAY rises → Q1 switches → DRIVER_ENABLE allowed.
  - Prevents immediate full current at cold start.
